{"homeWinPercentage":0.0445,"playId":"401871056281","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0413,"playId":"401871056285","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0456,"playId":"401871056289","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0451,"playId":"401871056294","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0437,"playId":"401871056299","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0479,"playId":"401871056304","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0476,"playId":"401871056309","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0461,"playId":"401871056312","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.048,"playId":"401871056316","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0531,"playId":"401871056321","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0548,"playId":"401871056326","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0554,"playId":"401871056330","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.057,"playId":"401871056335","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.056,"playId":"401871056341","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0607,"playId":"401871056339","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0563,"playId":"401871056345","tiePercentage":0},{"homeWinPercentage":0.0691,"playId":"401871056349","tiePercentage":0}],"gameInfo":{"venue":{"id":"4899","guid":"acec74f1-fe5f-35ad-8576-533a6b048c70","fullName":"Walens Family Field at Fifth Third Stadium","address":{"city":"Kennesaw","state":"GA","zipCode":"30144","country":"USA"},"grass":true,"images":[]},"attendance":8159},"article":{"headline":"Jaylon Coleman scores 2 TDs in Liberty's 34-6 win over Kennesaw State","description":"— Jaylon Coleman had a touchdown reception and a 9-yard rushing TD to help Liberty beat Kennesaw State 34-6 on Thursday night.","story":"KENNESAW, Ga. -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5296294/jaylon-coleman\" target=\"_new\">Jaylon Coleman</a> had a touchdown reception and a 9-yard rushing TD to help Liberty beat Kennesaw State 34-6 on Thursday night. \n\n\r\n              Kennesaw State (1-6, 0-3 Conference USA) has lost six in a row since a season-opening <a href=\"https://apnews.com/article/west-georgia-kennesaw-state-football-score-b4feb47a0f793f94c04eef8e7cfdc023\">47-0</a> win over West Georgia. \n\n\r\n              Liberty (6-1, 3-1) went 85 yards in 11 plays on its opening drive to take a 7-0 lead when <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5079364/kam-davis\" target=\"_new\">Kam Davis</a> rushed for a 1-yard touchdown with 7:11 left in the first quarter. \n\n\r\n              After the teams traded three-and-outs, <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4812377/elijah-hopkins\" target=\"_new\">Elijah Hopkins</a> broke up a fourth-and-4 pass that gave Liberty possession at its own 26. Three plays later <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5138131/deshawn-purdie\" target=\"_new\">Deshawn Purdie</a> hit Coleman for a 56-yard catch-and-run touchdown that made it 14-0 with 53 seconds until the second quarter. \n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5295514/daniel-kinney\" target=\"_new\">Daniel Kinney</a> kicked a 37-yard field goal with 31 seconds left in the first half and a 28-yarder that capped the scoring with 1:11 to play. \n\n\r\n              An interception by <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4838682/derrell-farrar\" target=\"_new\">Derrell Farrar</a> gave Liberty possession at the Owls 12 and set up a 30-yard field goal by <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5086151/chase-reeves\" target=\"_new\">Chase Reeves</a> that made it 17-3 early in the third quarter and Coleman scored a 9-yard rushing touchdown about 9 minutes later to give the Flames a 21-point lead. \n\n\r\n              After Farrar and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4808746/micah-pollard\" target=\"_new\">Micah Pollard</a> stopped <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5220641/boogie-woods\" target=\"_new\">Boogie Woods III</a> for no gain on a fourth-and-1, Reeves made a 49-yarder with 14:05 left in the game and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4880964/terron-kellman\" target=\"_new\">Terron Kellman</a>'s 2-yard touchdown run made it 34-3 with 5:26 to play. \n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Liberty: Hosts Florida International on Halloween. \n\n\r\n              Kennesaw State: Visits Middle Tennessee on Wednesday. \n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"https://apnews.com/newsletters\">Sign up for Top 25 poll alerts here</a>, visit <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/ap-top-25-college-football-poll\">the Top 25 here</a> and see AP’s full <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/college-football\">college football coverage here</a>","published":"2026-10-23T02:21:07Z"}}